{
    "title": "Utopia \u2014 Private Messenger",
    "description": "Utopia is a breakthrough decentralized and private P2P messenger with no central server involved in data transmission or storage.\r\n\r\nIntroducing Utopia: the ultimate private messenger app and Tor alternative that respects your privacy! With Utopia, there's no need to provide your email or phone number. As a fully decentralized messenger with no servers, Utopia secure messenger ensures your messages stay private and secure. It's censorship-free thanks to the unique nature of the Utopia protocol. Say goodbye to Big Tech and hello to Utopia private messenger - the superior Tor alternative to traditional messaging apps.\r\n\r\nUtopia P2P is a private and anonymous messenger without users identification. For registration, you don\u2019t need a phone number SMS approval, ID card, or email address. Everything you need is to create a chat and invite a friend or several friends.\r\n\r\nWith Utopia Tor alternative, you can send secure instant text messages, transfer files, create group chats and channels, news feeds and conduct a private discussion inside a secure messenger.\r\n\r\nUtopia P2P ChatGPT inside the Messenger\r\n\r\nAlso, inside the Utopia P2P Messenger Tor alternative, you can use ChatGPT \u2014 your personal AI assistant available 24/7 right after installing the app.\r\n\r\nAI assistant answers your questions and provides helpful information in real time. With Utopia Messenger, you can have the power of ChatGPT in your pocket, absolutely free.\r\n----------------------------------------\r\nUtopia Messenger \u2014 Features\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\u2022 Send encrypted messages;\r\n\u2022 No email or phone number required to sign up, just create a username and password to start messaging through the private messenger;\r\n\u2022 100% decentralized - all user data is stored right on your phone, in secure and encrypted storage;\r\n\u2022 Personalized support 24/7 with free ChatGPT AI assistant;\r\n\u2022 Worldwide access without expectations;\r\n\u2022 Access to all functions for free\r\n\u2022 Get push notifications;\r\n\u2022 Change color themes;\r\n\r\nDiscrete Message Sending With End-to-End Encryption\r\nAll messages are confidential & sent peer to peer (P2P) with no relay to a central server. All user data is stored on your device meaning you are the only person who can access your account.\r\n\r\nHigh Speed Encrypted Messaging\r\nSend & receive private messages instantly. Utopia uses blockchain technology & high-speed elliptic curve cryptography to encrypt and send messages.\r\n\r\nPrivate Messenger\r\nNo risks of data leaks or hacker attacks. Secure data transmission without traces and third-party eyes. Anonymous usage and fully-fledged data protection.\r\n\r\nTor Alternative\r\nReliable and trusted alternative to Tor. No limits and risks of blocking on the territory of countries. Secure and private access to data with a multifunctional arsenal of perks.\r\n\r\nHow It Works\r\n1. Create a username and password to sign in \u2014 no email or phone number required\r\n2. Get your Public Key and uCode from the Settings page, this is how others will find you\r\n3. Add contacts by searching for their Public Keys\r\n4. Start messaging\r\n\r\nCheck us out on the web: https://u.is",
    "descriptionHTML": "Utopia is a breakthrough decentralized and private P2P messenger with no central server involved in data transmission or storage.<br><br>Introducing Utopia: the ultimate private messenger app and Tor alternative that respects your privacy! With Utopia, there&#39;s no need to provide your email or phone number. As a fully decentralized messenger with no servers, Utopia secure messenger ensures your messages stay private and secure. It&#39;s censorship-free thanks to the unique nature of the Utopia protocol. Say goodbye to Big Tech and hello to Utopia private messenger - the superior Tor alternative to traditional messaging apps.<br><br>Utopia P2P is a private and anonymous messenger without users identification. For registration, you don\u2019t need a phone number SMS approval, ID card, or email address. Everything you need is to create a chat and invite a friend or several friends.<br><br>With Utopia Tor alternative, you can send secure instant text messages, transfer files, create group chats and channels, news feeds and conduct a private discussion inside a secure messenger.<br><br>Utopia P2P ChatGPT inside the Messenger<br><br>Also, inside the Utopia P2P Messenger Tor alternative, you can use ChatGPT \u2014 your personal AI assistant available 24/7 right after installing the app.<br><br>AI assistant answers your questions and provides helpful information in real time. With Utopia Messenger, you can have the power of ChatGPT in your pocket, absolutely free.<br>----------------------------------------<br>Utopia Messenger \u2014 Features<br>----------------------------------------<br>\u2022 Send encrypted messages;<br>\u2022 No email or phone number required to sign up, just create a username and password to start messaging through the private messenger;<br>\u2022 100% decentralized - all user data is stored right on your phone, in secure and encrypted storage;<br>\u2022 Personalized support 24/7 with free ChatGPT AI assistant;<br>\u2022 Worl